flowchart TD
    START([▶ Start Application\nstreamlit run app.py]) --> LOAD

    LOAD{Load Data} -->|Use demo| GEN[Generate Synthetic Dataset\n1000 records · 5 classes]
    LOAD -->|Upload CSV| UPLOAD[Parse and Validate CSV]

    GEN --> VAL
    UPLOAD --> VAL{Schema Valid?}
    VAL -->|❌ Missing columns\nor empty file| ERR1[Display Error\nShow expected format]
    ERR1 --> LOAD
    VAL -->|✅ Valid| INSPECT

    INSPECT[Data Explorer\nPreview · Column info · Class distribution] --> PREP

    PREP[Preprocess\nFill nulls · Remove inf · Encode] --> LABEL_CHECK

    LABEL_CHECK{Label column\npresent?} -->|❌ No label| PRED_ONLY[Prediction-Only Mode]
    LABEL_CHECK -->|✅ Has label| SPLIT

    SPLIT[Stratified 75/25 Split\nFixed random seed = 42] --> TRAIN_CHECK

    TRAIN_CHECK{Enough samples\nper class ≥ 5?} -->|❌ Too few| ERR2[Display Error\nNeed more samples]
    ERR2 --> LOAD
    TRAIN_CHECK -->|✅ Sufficient| TRAIN

    TRAIN[Train Random Forest\n150 trees · balanced weights\nColumnTransformer preprocessing] --> EVAL

    EVAL[Evaluate on Held-Out Test Set\nAccuracy · Precision · Recall · F1] --> METRICS

    METRICS[Display Metrics\nConfusion Matrix · Per-class Scores\nFP/FN Counts · Feature Importance] --> ANALYSE

    ANALYSE[Analyse New Records\nClassify · Assign Risk Level\nCompute Confidence Score] --> DISPLAY

    PRED_ONLY --> ANALYSE

    DISPLAY[Dashboard\nThreat Analysis · Insights\nModel Evaluation · Limitations] --> ANALYST

    ANALYST([👁️ Analyst Review\nInterpret predictions\nApply domain knowledge\nHuman decision]) --> DONE

    DONE([✅ Session Complete\nRetrain with new data\nor upload new records])

    ERR1 -.->|Retry| LOAD
    ERR2 -.->|Retry| LOAD

